# VMS-41R1 qualification-pack regression checklist

- [ ] Frozen qualification pack loads with 6 cases, 6 reference candidates and 4 negative checks.
- [ ] Manifest case order, attempt IDs, side-effect authorization and nonclaims are exact.
- [ ] Public per-case manifests do not expose hidden acceptable sets, reference candidates or negative checks.
- [ ] Real source receipt is self-contained, zero-mutation and independent from VMS-41 source IDs.
- [ ] Negative checks are recomputed from hidden references and not trusted as stored summaries.
- [ ] Member tamper, extra files and symlinks fail closed.
- [ ] Builder imports no model, Solver, DB, network or subprocess client.
